Z||000011||Dave Gunsul||11-07-2001||11:37 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by flyntus:<P><BR>[/b]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>I got an email from Darrell last week saying that he no longer ports the exhaust manifolds because he couldn't guarantee the quality that he was after.<P>[/B][/QUOTE]<P>That's a shame, his quality was alway very good before.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>Next time I see him at a show i'll ask him about it. Thanks for the heads up though.<P><P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||9
Z||000012||FieroKyle||11-07-2001||11:48 PM||||Even though your getting a HP increase, your losing the torque, performance wise it even worth it to get them???? <P>Like 1FST2M6 says, HP sells cars, Torque wins races.||||reg||1
Z||000013||Dave Gunsul||11-08-2001||02:07 AM||||[QUOTE]Originally posted by FieroKyle:<BR>[B]Even though your getting a HP increase, your losing the torque, performance wise it even worth it to get them???? <P>A good header should give you more HP and more torque. It will move your torque band higher though even if it does increase your torque. A bad header can make big HP numbers<BR>but make the car an absolute pig on the bottom end because of loss of torque.<BR>By good and bad I mean good or bad for your particular application. <P><P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
Z||000014||Boomtastic||11-08-2001||09:43 PM||||I picked up a used (8k miles) set for $200. I had Ed Parks toss 'em on when he was doing some other work for me and he said that they put up more of a fight than a prize fighter. Seems they're not the flatest items in the world, hence they are a pain to bolt up. Add into the equation that they didn't fit well with Rodney Dickman's crossover water pipe (needed at the same time) and the A/C compressor and you can see the swears coming out of Ed's mouth. Are they worth it? I haven't noticed any horsepower increase, but I have noticed an increase in engine compartment heat. For sound, everyone tells me that they notice a difference - I do not. To each his/her own I guess ...<P>------------------<BR>Boomtastic<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mirror_md_clr.gif"> ||||reg||1
